{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_05",
  "title": "逃票？",
  "storyCode": "RS-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2b6bd4a762a0c0bbab8b3751c12396fb36fe1f259f926137f0ecfa81e1b859ae",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "拉住我的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喝——哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "之前在列車上有過一面之緣，沒想到在這裡還會被您所救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "多虧了您伸出援手，否則我不知還要在這裡被困多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "我很感謝，羅莎琳·塔季揚諾夫娜·拉里娜小姐，感謝您的無私幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "……唔，小事，不用謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你看起來肯定不是當地人，上山應該也是來旅遊的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "正是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那你怎麼不沿著大路走，跑到這種林子裡來不說，還掉進人家打獵挖的陷阱裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "萬一我沒正好路過，你打算怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "我只是被山間的景色吸引，沒有想到積雪之下會有這樣的陷阱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "如果沒有您路過解救……那我正好可以多待一會。冷靜一下，再想辦法自己爬出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "不過現在看來，我還是幸運的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "唔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "羅莎琳小姐，您是要繼續上山嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯？對，沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "如果您不介意，我們可以同行一段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "我也想要欣賞一番謝拉格雪山上頂的風光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "……好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我不介意，那我們走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "距離山頂還有好一段路程呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "剛剛那是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "text": "萊利老爹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "text": "我檢查過了，我們佈置在這附近的陷阱被踩塌了一個，應該是有獵物掉進去過！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "text": "但我看的時候裡面什麼也沒有，估計是又逃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "你看到剛剛過去的那人沒有？你看他，像不像圖里爾那老小子說要找的那人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "text": "你是說，是鐧小姐拜託我們找的那個……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "穿得烏漆嘛黑、裝模作樣的，戴著帽子還遮著臉，錯不了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "text": "走！我們回去，趕快把這事告訴鐧小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "喂，那個誰……對了，我還不知道你叫什麼名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你們不是都講究什麼，見面要先互相告知姓名嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "這是我疏忽了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "鄙人名叫約翰‧史密斯，隨便您怎麼稱呼都可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "約翰……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你這名字……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "名字如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你這名字……聽起來和之前博士看的什麼間諜電影的主角一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "對，我沒記錯，就是這個名字！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我記得主人公還有個大美女搭檔，約翰你……算了，看你能一個人來這種情侶景點，就知道你一定沒對象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "真是個有趣的巧合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "對吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "好了約翰，言歸正傳，我們估計還要爬一會才能到山頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我聽人說過，雪山越往上就越冷，而且還會讓人越來越喘不上氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "怎麼樣，你累不累？要不要休息一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "請不必擔心我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "羅莎琳小姐需要休息一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我就不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "看來你的體力不錯，“間諜先生”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "看來，他確實被你騙到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我並沒有編造謊言，鐧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "“灰禮帽”是為公爵蒐集情報的密探，一般的謊言瞞不過他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "但我深知，這種人往往最懂得“猜忌”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "“佩爾羅契家的繼承人秘密歸國”，這是他自己最先發現的事實，所以他一定會相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "對方一定會盯上羅莎琳·塔季揚諾夫娜·拉里娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "你總能猜對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "那女孩已經上山，菈塔托絲也聯絡了阿克托斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我接到消息，那個“灰禮帽“也跟上去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "他在躲著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "無妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "確認他將注意力放在那女孩身上就夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "你也該出發了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "好吧，就當飯後運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "不過，你確定放任“灰禮帽”接近那個女孩，之後那個博士不會找你麻煩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "「灰禮帽」是間諜，不是殺手，他要的是情報，而不是性命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "你打算這麼向那個博士解釋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "博士那邊我會向他——道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "你確實該道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我如何不重要，相較之下，我更好奇——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "鐧，你也記得博士了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "Sharp作為對手來說還不錯，比大部分草包騎士強得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "能被那樣的戰士推崇，又能讓你吃點虧，這人記一記也無妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "你對博士很好奇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "可以這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "好了，閒話就到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我該辦正事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "呀吼——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "終於到了——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "呼，一共爬了有幾個小時了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "累死我了，怪不得大家都選擇留在山腰，這也太累人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "不過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "這裡的風景確實不錯……那邊那個是不是銀心湖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈，從這看耶拉岡德像還沒我拇指大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "冬季的銀心湖會冰封，從這裡看下去，就像是一塊色彩澄淨的寶石一般。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "因此，謝拉格當地人都認為銀心湖是耶拉岡德賜下的瑰寶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "確實是只有站得夠高才能看到的風景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "確實還挺像寶石的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哦，那邊還能看到車站！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "這麼看謝拉格的鐵路也不少了嘛，就是列車看起來像玩具一樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "對於一個正在發展的國家來說，這樣的鐵道數量並不算多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "會看起來數量眾多，只是因為這裡是銀心湖，還有耶拉岡德像在此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "雖然目前還不比聖山，但已經修建通車的鐵道線路，都會途經這裡，在此中轉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……目前的路線都會在銀心湖中轉……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "別發呆了，約翰，幫我個忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "能幫我在這附近找找有沒有長在一起的兩棵樹嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "應該是老樹，枝幹的部分纏在一起，形狀看起來很奇怪的兩棵樹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "樂意效勞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "謝了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "說起來，約翰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你都不問問我找樹是要幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你是不是也沒問過我，我上山是要幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我琢磨了一下……還是決定用我更擅長的辦法解決問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "老實點別亂動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……羅莎琳小姐，您這是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "別這副口吻，我還沒把你怎麼樣呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "說吧，你暗中跟了我這麼久，到山頂也沒個動作，到底想幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "我不明白您的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "少裝傻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我不記得有告訴過你我的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……這是個誤會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "您知道，我和哈洛德·克雷加文子爵閣下有舊，是他向我透露了羅莎琳小姐的姓名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你是不是覺得我很好騙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我根本就沒告訴那個大叔我的全名，他怎麼可能告訴你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "而且你這傢伙能一口氣爬上山頂，連喘都不喘兩聲，根本不可能掉進普通獵人挖的陷阱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "就算掉進去，也不至於上不來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "安娜她們總是要我多想想再行動，但要我說，有時候想太多反而沒用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“約翰·史密斯”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "您比我想的要細心許多，羅莎琳小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你這是承認了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "約翰·史密斯這個名字多半也是假的吧？難道說……你真是間諜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "如果我說我是呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那你這行一定做得不怎麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "連我都看得出來不對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "您的指摘完全正確。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "事實上，我確實有許多大意之處，在謝拉格的生活讓我有些疏於遮掩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "畢竟在謝拉格境內的行動還算自由，並且能夠對我有所威脅的人，實在不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哈，口氣不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我警告你，老實點，別想亂動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "你現在可是在山崖邊，腳下只有積雪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "只要我跺跺腳，這裡的雪就會崩落，到時候我可不敢保證一定會拉住你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "好吧，羅莎琳小姐，那我也直說好了，你昨天……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "維多利亞的小子！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "阿克托斯在此！你給我離她遠點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哇！你、你從哪冒出來的啊大叔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊等下！你別跺腳，等下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哇啊啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "羅、羅莎琳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "抓住我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "雖然有些滑稽，但阿克托斯顯然是衝著我來的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "難道說，羅莎琳真的是帶著目的來到這座山上的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "無論如何，來都來了，只能跳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……黑騎士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "休息好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "還沒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "打起來少點意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "這麼直接？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "直接不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "那麼我也直接一點吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "你讓哈洛德子爵相信，列車上的一切都是誤會，當時我也只是半信半疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "而現在，我知道了，原來堂堂黑騎士也會騙人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "那表示你對我的了解還遠遠不夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "現在轉身下山，還能好好吃一頓午飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "抱歉，我一旦投入工作，就會廢寢忘食。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
